OL,3,AMourners killed by Kenya police at
OL,4,Aex-PM's national farewell not part of
OL,5,Aviolence, BBC finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree mourners killed when Kenyan
OL,8,Fpolice opened fire at a national
OL,9,Ffarewell for former Prime Minister
OL,10,FRaila Odinga were not involved in a
OL,11,Fclash that sparked gunfire, a BBC
OL,12,FAfrica Eye investigation has found.
OL,14,FDuring an event held last October for
OL,15,Fpeople to pay their respects to Odinga,
OL,16,Fthree people were shot dead after
OL,17,Fmourners attempted to gain access to
OL,18,Fthe VIP section of Nairobi's Kasarani
OL,19,FStadium by force.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
