OL,3,AMourners killed by Kenya police at
OL,4,Aex-PM's national farewell not part of
OL,5,Aviolence, BBC finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FBBC analysis from inside the stadium
OL,8,Fshows the victims were each between at
OL,9,Fleast 60m (197 ft) and 160m from the
OL,10,Fscuffles.
OL,12,FKenya's Interior Minister Kipchumba
OL,13,FMurkomen told the BBC that the police
OL,14,Faction had been "restrained" after the
OL,15,Fcrowd starting throwing stones.
